{"id":"669ee474b9646a38","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-VF.md","title":"VF理论（Cantini变体）","display":"df-VF — VF理论（Cantini变体）","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-VF","aliases":["91-df-VF","91-df-cantini-VF"],"display":"df-VF — VF理论（Cantini变体）","depends_on":["[[91-df-language-with-truth]]","[[91-df-truth-theory]]","[[91-df-supervaluation]]","[[91-df-truth-consistency]]","[[91-df-substitution-function]]","[[91-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-VF"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-VF</span><span>91-df-cantini-VF</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-VF — VF理论（Cantini变体）"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"97fe560478d37064\" href=\"?note=97fe560478d37064\" title=\"91-df-language-with-truth\">91-df-language-with-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"024b320d234d188f\" href=\"?note=024b320d234d188f\" title=\"91-df-truth-theory\">91-df-truth-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3f012d0f8371bf9a\" href=\"?note=3f012d0f8371bf9a\" title=\"91-df-supervaluation\">91-df-supervaluation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fb5e07d472a8bf03\" href=\"?note=fb5e07d472a8bf03\" title=\"91-df-truth-consistency\">91-df-truth-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"95643c507a4d6dc3\" href=\"?note=95643c507a4d6dc3\" title=\"91-df-substitution-function\">91-df-substitution-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-VF-—-VF理论-$\\mathrm{VF}$\">df-VF — VF理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VF}\">\\(\\mathrm{VF}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_T\\)</span> (含真理谓词的算术语言, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"97fe560478d37064\" href=\"?note=97fe560478d37064\" title=\"91-df-language-with-truth\">91-df-language-with-truth</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}_T\\)</span> (在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_T\\)</span> 中表述的 PA，含扩展语言归纳)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\)</span> (经典一阶逻辑的演绎闭包)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (真理谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> (固定的 Gödel 编码)，并记\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\chi\\coloneqq\\overline{\\ulcorner\\chi\\urcorner}\">\\(\\widehat\\chi\\coloneqq\\overline{\\ulcorner\\chi\\urcorner}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}^{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}^{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span>\n(数码代入编码的对象语言表示, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"95643c507a4d6dc3\" href=\"?note=95643c507a4d6dc3\" title=\"91-df-substitution-function\">91-df-substitution-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PA}_T}(x)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PA}_T}(x)\\)</span>、\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}(x)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}(x)\\)</span>\n(PA<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"_T\">\\(_T\\)</span> 公理编码与句子编码的算术谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Eq},\\operatorname{Neq},\\operatorname{All},\n\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{Tr},\\operatorname{Neg},\n\\operatorname{Imp},\\operatorname{SentForm}:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\operatorname{Eq},\\operatorname{Neq},\\operatorname{All},\n\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{Tr},\\operatorname{Neg},\n\\operatorname{Imp},\\operatorname{SentForm}:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>\n(固定编码下相应句法构造的总原始递归编码函数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ClTerm}_{\\mathcal L_T}(x)\">\\(\\operatorname{ClTerm}_{\\mathcal L_T}(x)\\)</span> 与\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}(x)\">\\(\\operatorname{val}(x)\\)</span> (闭项编码谓词及闭项求值函数)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<p>Cantini 的 VF 采用下列九组公理。首先，释放模式为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VF}_1\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\forall\\vec x\\,\n\\left(\nT\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}^{\\mathcal L_T}\n(\\widehat\\varphi,\\vec x)\n\\right)\n\\to\\varphi\n\\right)\n\\;\\middle|\\;\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_T},\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\vec x\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{VF}_1\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\forall\\vec x\\,\n\\left(\nT\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}^{\\mathcal L_T}\n(\\widehat\\varphi,\\vec x)\n\\right)\n\\to\\varphi\n\\right)\n\\;\\middle|\\;\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_T},\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\vec x\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其余八项是编码层的单句：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{VF}_2\\;:\\;&amp;\n\\forall s,t\\,\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{ClTerm}_{\\mathcal L_T}(s)\\land\n\\operatorname{ClTerm}_{\\mathcal L_T}(t)\n\\to\\\\[-1mm]\n&amp;\\quad\n\\bigl(T(\\operatorname{Eq}(s,t))\n\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}(s)=\\operatorname{val}(t)\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(T(\\operatorname{Neq}(s,t))\n\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}(s)\\ne\\operatorname{val}(t)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{VF}_3\\;:\\;&amp;\n\\forall x\\,\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PA}_T}(x)\\to T(x)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{VF}_4\\;:\\;&amp;\n\\forall v,x\\,\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}(\\operatorname{All}(v,x))\n\\to\\\\[-1mm]\n&amp;\\quad\n\\bigl[\n\\forall t\\,\n(\\operatorname{ClTerm}_{\\mathcal L_T}(t)\n\\to T(\\operatorname{Sub}(x,t,v)))\n\\to T(\\operatorname{All}(v,x))\n\\bigr]\n\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{VF}_5\\;:\\;&amp;\n\\forall x\\,(T(x)\\to T(\\operatorname{Tr}(x))),\\\\\n\\mathrm{VF}_6\\;:\\;&amp;\n\\forall x\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}(x)\\land\nT(\\operatorname{Neg}(\\operatorname{Tr}(x)))\n\\to T(\\operatorname{Neg}(x))\n\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{VF}_7\\;:\\;&amp;\n\\forall x,y\\,\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}(\\operatorname{Imp}(x,y))\n\\to\\\\[-1mm]\n&amp;\\quad\n\\bigl(\nT(\\operatorname{Imp}(x,y))\n\\to(T(x)\\to T(y))\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{VF}_8\\;:\\;&amp;\n\\forall x\\,\nT\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Imp}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Tr}(x),\n\\operatorname{Neg}(\\operatorname{Tr}(\\operatorname{Neg}(x)))\n\\bigr)\n\\right),\\\\\n\\mathrm{VF}_9\\;:\\;&amp;\n\\forall x\\,\nT\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Imp}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Tr}(x),\n\\operatorname{SentForm}(x)\n\\bigr)\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{VF}_2\\;:\\;&amp;\n\\forall s,t\\,\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{ClTerm}_{\\mathcal L_T}(s)\\land\n\\operatorname{ClTerm}_{\\mathcal L_T}(t)\n\\to\\\\[-1mm]\n&amp;\\quad\n\\bigl(T(\\operatorname{Eq}(s,t))\n\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}(s)=\\operatorname{val}(t)\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(T(\\operatorname{Neq}(s,t))\n\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}(s)\\ne\\operatorname{val}(t)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{VF}_3\\;:\\;&amp;\n\\forall x\\,\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PA}_T}(x)\\to T(x)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{VF}_4\\;:\\;&amp;\n\\forall v,x\\,\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}(\\operatorname{All}(v,x))\n\\to\\\\[-1mm]\n&amp;\\quad\n\\bigl[\n\\forall t\\,\n(\\operatorname{ClTerm}_{\\mathcal L_T}(t)\n\\to T(\\operatorname{Sub}(x,t,v)))\n\\to T(\\operatorname{All}(v,x))\n\\bigr]\n\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{VF}_5\\;:\\;&amp;\n\\forall x\\,(T(x)\\to T(\\operatorname{Tr}(x))),\\\\\n\\mathrm{VF}_6\\;:\\;&amp;\n\\forall x\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}(x)\\land\nT(\\operatorname{Neg}(\\operatorname{Tr}(x)))\n\\to T(\\operatorname{Neg}(x))\n\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{VF}_7\\;:\\;&amp;\n\\forall x,y\\,\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}(\\operatorname{Imp}(x,y))\n\\to\\\\[-1mm]\n&amp;\\quad\n\\bigl(\nT(\\operatorname{Imp}(x,y))\n\\to(T(x)\\to T(y))\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{VF}_8\\;:\\;&amp;\n\\forall x\\,\nT\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Imp}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Tr}(x),\n\\operatorname{Neg}(\\operatorname{Tr}(\\operatorname{Neg}(x)))\n\\bigr)\n\\right),\\\\\n\\mathrm{VF}_9\\;:\\;&amp;\n\\forall x\\,\nT\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Imp}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Tr}(x),\n\\operatorname{SentForm}(x)\n\\bigr)\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{VF}}\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{VF}_1\\cup\\{\\mathrm{VF}_2,\\ldots,\\mathrm{VF}_9\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{VF}}\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{VF}_1\\cup\\{\\mathrm{VF}_2,\\ldots,\\mathrm{VF}_9\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>于是</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}VF}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{VF}\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\bigl(\\mathrm{PA}_T\\cup\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{VF}}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}VF}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{VF}\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\bigl(\\mathrm{PA}_T\\cup\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{VF}}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VF}\">\\(\\mathrm{VF}\\)</span> : VF理论（Verum Falsum，Cantini变体）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{VF}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{VF}}\\)</span> : VF公理系统</li>\n</ul>\n<p>说明：VF 是 Cantini 提出的、以一致超赋值固定点为意向语义的经典真理理论。\n它的外部演绎逻辑是经典逻辑，但公理并不给出任意复合式的全组合性双条件。\n特别地，不能把\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\lor\\psi\\urcorner)\">\\(T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\lor\\psi\\urcorner)\\)</span>\n一般化约为\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\lor T(\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner)\">\\(T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\lor T(\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner)\\)</span>；\n这正是超赋值语义与强 Kleene 组合语义的关键差别。</p>\n<p>公理组的作用是：VF<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"_1\">\\(_1\\)</span> 是释放（T-Out）模式；VF<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"_2\">\\(_2\\)</span> 固定算术\n原子句；VF<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"_3\">\\(_3\\)</span>–VF<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"_4\">\\(_4\\)</span> 给出公理真与量词闭包；VF<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"_5\">\\(_5\\)</span>–VF<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"_6\">\\(_6\\)</span>\n给出正、负内省；VF<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"_7\">\\(_7\\)</span> 给出真理内部的 modus ponens；VF<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"_8\">\\(_8\\)</span>\n内部表达真理的一致性；VF<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"_9\">\\(_9\\)</span> 限定真理的适用域。这里所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>\n的实参都是对象语言数项或代码运算项，没有把元层\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\chi\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\chi\\urcorner\\)</span> 直接塞入对象公式。\n因此，VF 既不是“基于弱 Kleene 的 KF”，也不是“完整否定双条件的部分逻辑”。\n其标准证明论强度与一个正归纳定义理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ID}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{ID}_1\\)</span> 相当，因而显著强于 KF。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-VF-—-VF理论-$\\mathrm{VF}$","text":"df-VF — VF理论 $\\mathrm{VF}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-language-with-truth","status":"resolved","id":"97fe560478d37064","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-language-with-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-theory","status":"resolved","id":"024b320d234d188f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-supervaluation","status":"resolved","id":"3f012d0f8371bf9a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-supervaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"fb5e07d472a8bf03","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"95643c507a4d6dc3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-substitution-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-language-with-truth","status":"resolved","id":"97fe560478d37064","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{L}_T$ (含真理谓词的算术语言, see [[91-df-language-with-truth]])","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"95643c507a4d6dc3","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}^{\\mathcal L_T}$\n(数码代入编码的对象语言表示, see [[91-df-substitution-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{VF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat\\chi\\coloneqq\\overline{\\ulcorner\\chi\\urcorner}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}^{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PA}_T}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Eq},\\operatorname{Neq},\\operatorname{All},\n\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{Tr},\\operatorname{Neg},\n\\operatorname{Imp},\\operatorname{SentForm}:\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ClTerm}_{\\mathcal L_T}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VF}_1\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\forall\\vec x\\,\n\\left(\nT\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}^{\\mathcal L_T}\n(\\widehat\\varphi,\\vec x)\n\\right)\n\\to\\varphi\n\\right)\n\\;\\middle|\\;\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_T},\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\vec x\n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{VF}_2\\;:\\;&\n\\forall s,t\\,\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{ClTerm}_{\\mathcal L_T}(s)\\land\n\\operatorname{ClTerm}_{\\mathcal L_T}(t)\n\\to\\\\[-1mm]\n&\\quad\n\\bigl(T(\\operatorname{Eq}(s,t))\n\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}(s)=\\operatorname{val}(t)\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(T(\\operatorname{Neq}(s,t))\n\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}(s)\\ne\\operatorname{val}(t)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{VF}_3\\;:\\;&\n\\forall x\\,\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PA}_T}(x)\\to T(x)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{VF}_4\\;:\\;&\n\\forall v,x\\,\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}(\\operatorname{All}(v,x))\n\\to\\\\[-1mm]\n&\\quad\n\\bigl[\n\\forall t\\,\n(\\operatorname{ClTerm}_{\\mathcal L_T}(t)\n\\to T(\\operatorname{Sub}(x,t,v)))\n\\to T(\\operatorname{All}(v,x))\n\\bigr]\n\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{VF}_5\\;:\\;&\n\\forall x\\,(T(x)\\to T(\\operatorname{Tr}(x))),\\\\\n\\mathrm{VF}_6\\;:\\;&\n\\forall x\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}(x)\\land\nT(\\operatorname{Neg}(\\operatorname{Tr}(x)))\n\\to T(\\operatorname{Neg}(x))\n\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{VF}_7\\;:\\;&\n\\forall x,y\\,\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}(\\operatorname{Imp}(x,y))\n\\to\\\\[-1mm]\n&\\quad\n\\bigl(\nT(\\operatorname{Imp}(x,y))\n\\to(T(x)\\to T(y))\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{VF}_8\\;:\\;&\n\\forall x\\,\nT\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Imp}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Tr}(x),\n\\operatorname{Neg}(\\operatorname{Tr}(\\operatorname{Neg}(x)))\n\\bigr)\n\\right),\\\\\n\\mathrm{VF}_9\\;:\\;&\n\\forall x\\,\nT\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Imp}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Tr}(x),\n\\operatorname{SentForm}(x)\n\\bigr)\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{VF}}\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{VF}_1\\cup\\{\\mathrm{VF}_2,\\ldots,\\mathrm{VF}_9\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}VF}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{VF}\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\bigl(\\mathrm{PA}_T\\cup\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{VF}}\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{VF}}","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\lor\\psi\\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\lor T(\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"_1","display":false},{"tex":"_2","display":false},{"tex":"_3","display":false},{"tex":"_4","display":false},{"tex":"_5","display":false},{"tex":"_6","display":false},{"tex":"_7","display":false},{"tex":"_8","display":false},{"tex":"_9","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\chi\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ID}_1","d